    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16677" root="رمق" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِمَاقٌ</span></b> , <i>Straitness,</i> or <i>narrowness,</i> of the means
of subsistence. (K. [In the CK, for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الضِّيقُ</span> is put
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الضَّيِّقُ</span>, which makes the meaning to be “ strait, ”
or “ narrow, ” as applied to the means of subsistence.]) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُمْقَةٌ</span>.

